{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_06_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_06","title":"10:26P.M.","storyCode":"CB-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"75953b8cd8167fc6aa6d56d47108303db6ba52f5518a85faa59eb14a057b0ace","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面對全力以赴的企鵝物流，甘比諾家族迅速敗下陣來，但酒吧也已經被破壞殆盡，惱怒的大帝終於下定決心，正面決戰拉開帷幕。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上好，敘拉古的喪家犬，弩彈打完了？可我怎麼還活著呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"真不愧是大帝，槍林彈雨裡還端著酒杯，運氣不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門從來不會縱容真正的廝殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不按遊戲規則來，可是會被驅逐出局的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"規則？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"當龍門員警到場的時候，只會看到你們幾個支離破碎的屍首，企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......街道上都是他們的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"連後門都堵上了，唉，看來這位先生一直懷恨在心嘛，做得很徹底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭那個懦夫太過忌憚鼠王和魏彥吾了，後者興許值得關注......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你和那隻裝腔作勢的老鼠，除了讓人作嘔的本事一流之外，一文不值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你是真這麼覺得？還是單純想放狠話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"誠心實意，“大帝先生”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌，幫我撿瓶酒，我來幫他修理一下大腦皮層。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"但是老闆，不瞞你說，我們已經砸掉了上百萬龍門幣的紅酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......那他們的命值多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼看也不值這個數字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"要動真格的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢。我們一定會恪守和小魏的約定，在龍門之內，不打真架，不鬧人命，一切生意上的糾紛，在商言商。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"只是今天我們總計逃亡了五個小時，超出了我日常工作時間的兩倍，兩倍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅如此，我們還炸掉了整整一年份的行動補貼！汽車，紅酒，還有我的珍藏黑膠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，在我的酒吧發生了一些預料之內的意外死亡，這總沒什麼問題吧？嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你的名字就讓我感到不快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我不記得自己認識你這樣的敘拉古人。但你會再次夾著尾巴逃離龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你會後悔詆毀我的家族，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"到底誰才是逃來龍門的喪家之犬，你心裡清楚。你根本不配與西西里人為敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是像樣的表情，德克薩斯！這才有點敘拉古人的樣子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真是意料之外呢，你也是被叫過來的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。不過能從商務酒會脫身的感覺也不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這些黑手黨的小打小鬧，值得這麼興師動眾的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"不值得。而且我只是想從麻煩的社交裡脫身，找個機會喘口氣罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌為她的錘子定製了新的配件。能天使讓我幫忙保養她的守護銃。總之，還有很多事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也許我也得麻煩你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。除了本職工作，為同事們處理這些雜務，也是我的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"這把法杖，能幫我保管一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"白色的這把。你明白這其中的含義吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"至少今晚，就讓我輕鬆一點吧，只是一場狂歡而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我總不能真的帶著它跳進舞會現場，那會失控的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。交給我吧，這也是工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，說來說去，不還是工作嘛，你也真是辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"結束之後要不要去喝一杯？我請客好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"十分贊同。同事之間的酒會比無趣的應酬要好得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"但很可惜，看這動靜，也許大地的盡頭很難保全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，你是剛回來龍門？對今晚的事情知道多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"全部。這次狂歡的來龍去脈並不複雜，一切情報昭然若揭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你不打算去幫個忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒絕。體力勞動就交給年輕氣盛的孩子們吧，我就保管著你們幾個人的貨物，喝一杯茶，等著事情結束好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。既然鼠王已經在等著你，那就玩得開心一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"——你也是，伊斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"難得的安魂夜，就不要這麼辛苦地工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我先走一步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......安魂夜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，安魂夜應該放假來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼習慣性地加班了......嗯，虧大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少，她把你留給我了，我們可以難得敘敘舊了，老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，把你握在手上的感覺還不賴，抱怨也沒用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你無路可退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，哈啊，德克薩斯，你的身手倒是對得起你的名字......所以你的家族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"住口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯小姐~我比你多解決一個人哦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"但壓制頭目的人是德克薩斯，至少要算三個人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？所以算我輸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒人和你比這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這裡還有一瓶完整的，我看看價碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"一，二，三......七、七個零？謝天謝地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要怕！這些傢伙不過就五個人而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不許說這種爛俗的台詞！哦噠——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又、又砸頭......呃...."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"而且算上我，是六個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"六名物流公司員工和一整支武裝黑手黨正面衝突，贏家竟然是前者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——這也太奇怪了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼奇怪的喔？論打群架的本事，人數差不太多的話我們就是龍門第一！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你們輸了，投降吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"輸？投降？哈，你真的是那個“德克薩斯”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦拔劍相向，西西里人之間就不存在“輸贏”，只有“生死”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該後悔沒有痛下殺手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"引爆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——！注意掩護！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——又是炸彈——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖，又讓他們逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"要追嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我也稍微有點，低估敵人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算只是逃來龍門的失敗者，畢竟也是以西西里人自居的黑手黨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，你受傷了！？我、我來給你包紮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口不深，別緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行！先坐下！我去找一下醫療箱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里人......西西里人是什麼意思？是敘拉古人的某種稱呼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古十二家族起源之一的西西里聯合，是最開始透過暴力取得戰果的城邦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是敘拉古語中“西西里人”的詞源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在......這個詞有了別的某種含義......已經很少有敘拉古人以“西西里”自居了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他們也許因為各種原因......不再強大，但既然他們如此自稱......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，德克薩斯，一口氣說這麼多話很累吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"總之！他們真的是一群很危險的黑手黨！雖然是自稱的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更不能讓他們繼續這樣突然襲擊了，損失只會不斷擴大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得反擊，我們需要一個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，都先等等，你們覺得我該找什麼藉口，向那位酒精過敏的白癡調酒師解釋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"這還有的解釋嗎......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"至少老闆你坐著的高腳凳還是完好無缺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"就剩這張高腳凳了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，就剩這張高腳凳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，破碎的酒瓶和殘垣斷壁也有一種別樣的美感，沒錯，這正是本人獨特的風格化改造！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，這再怎麼扯也太牽強了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"還是準備好全額賠償吧，唔啊，企鵝物流的經濟寒冬要到來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"而且酒味好重，身上也黏黏的，不過正好可以給傷口消毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"別胡鬧了，哪有用葡萄酒消毒的！這裡有醫用酒精......為什麼有個吸管？不、不管了，德克薩斯，我來幫你消毒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......我改主意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他們執意要在安魂節這一天找麻煩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只好讓他們此世安息了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯","能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提馬"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
